```

The component was fine; the test was wrong. It compared a local-time month against `toISOString()`, which is UTC — after 8pm in Toronto (EDT, UTC−4) on the last day of the month, UTC is already in the next month, and in general the expectation drifted with the wall clock. The test now pins the clock to that exact edge case and asserts the full range. Passes under both `TZ=America/Toronto` and `TZ=UTC`.

