  return problem(reply, 409, 'Customer has open invoices', `${open} open invoice(s) must be paid or voided first`,
    'https://docs.acme.dev/errors/customer-has-open-invoices');
}
```

The 409 goes through `problem()` like the 400 and 404, with a specific `type` URI so clients can tell it apart from other conflicts. Open means draft, sent or overdue, counted within the caller's org. The check runs before the soft delete, so nothing is changed when it fails.

